Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:58:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(console,firmware): config page, voice settings, face UI
 and runtime wake word

- console: tabbed config page (role / model+memory / voice settings)
- console: real-time sync of persona, voice, model, wake word to voice service
- console: rich persona presets in structured format; custom persona dialog
- console: save bar with explicit save/cancel and state indicator
- console: filter embedding models out of the chat model list
- console: pinyin conversion and wake-word downto device via heartbeat
- firmware: dog face renderer (11 expressions, blink, speaking mouth)
- firmware: boot in text mode, auto switch to face when idle, long-press toggle
- firmware: runtime wake-word rebuild from console config, persisted in NVS
